<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup Friday - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle roundup Friday - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the panhandle area Friday, said the USDA.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reported light inquiry from buyers; following weekly movement of 58,100 head.</p>
<p>Confirmed:  None	    Week Ago: 1,600	  Year Ago: 6,400</p>
